{"3645620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ACCELERATE", "steam_appid": 3645620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>ACCELERATE: NOW ON STEAM</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ACCELERATE is now on Steam! Wishlist now to get notified on when the game fully releases.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L.O.G.O.S.</strong> has spiraled out of control - an error in its source code caused it to turn from a simple navigation system to an all-knowing and all-powerful threat. You're the only one who's capable of putting up a fight. Master different tech, weapons and suit-modules to stand a chance in this ultra-fast first-person shooter. Learn to use your high-tech suit, the <i>&quot;<strong>MVU</strong>&quot;</i> (Modular Velocity Unit) and its special abilities to kill enemies as quickly and efficiently as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/983d55af322702e66d53e81268545dd5.poster.avif?t=1763740805\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/983d55af322702e66d53e81268545dd5.webm?t=1763740805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/983d55af322702e66d53e81268545dd5.mp4?t=1763740805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ACCELERATE's <i>old-school boomer shooter</i>-inspired movement allows for very interesting combat. Swap between different weapons, each with their own primary / secondary fire and try to outmaneuver enemies to kill them. Dodge their attacks by using your slide and dash abilities. Upgrade the <strong>MVU</strong> to unlock special customizable abilities and choose the one that best fits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/bbf5e7ecb34aad3e27460bb34526544e.poster.avif?t=1763740805\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/bbf5e7ecb34aad3e27460bb34526544e.webm?t=1763740805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/bbf5e7ecb34aad3e27460bb34526544e.mp4?t=1763740805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Movement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement in ACCELERATE takes inspiration from games like <i>ULTRAKILL, Doom, Turbo Overkill</i> and classic arena shooters. Slide to gain speed, dash in any direction, launch yourself across arenas, and chain everything together into a constant flow. Use your weapons' special abilities to help you reach incredible speeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/632e1baadaa8a07b4e933a15d3984aeb.poster.avif?t=1763740805\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/632e1baadaa8a07b4e933a15d3984aeb.webm?t=1763740805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/632e1baadaa8a07b4e933a15d3984aeb.mp4?t=1763740805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/1ea117f60824438872b2154ee743828c.poster.avif?t=1763740805\" width=1170 height=427 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/1ea117f60824438872b2154ee743828c.webm?t=1763740805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growing arsenal of weapons, each with their own unique primary and secondary fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, momentum-heavy movement built around sliding, dashing, and special abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable MVU upgrades that let you choose a special ability to fit your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in Speedrun mode with integrated Steam Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable Difficulty</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Finally:<strong> Don't die.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/ccac532f76c27b7fec73d2ba982d3c4b.poster.avif?t=1763740805\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/ccac532f76c27b7fec73d2ba982d3c4b.webm?t=1763740805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/ccac532f76c27b7fec73d2ba982d3c4b.mp4?t=1763740805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L.O.G.O.S.</strong> has spiraled out of control - an error in its source code caused it to turn from a simple navigation system to an all-knowing and all-powerful threat. You're the only one who's capable of putting up a fight. Master different tech, weapons and suit-modules to stand a chance in this ultra-fast first-person shooter. Learn to use your high-tech suit, the <i>&quot;<strong>MVU</strong>&quot;</i> (Modular Velocity Unit) and its special abilities to kill enemies as quickly and efficiently as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/983d55af322702e66d53e81268545dd5.poster.avif?t=1763740805\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/983d55af322702e66d53e81268545dd5.webm?t=1763740805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/983d55af322702e66d53e81268545dd5.mp4?t=1763740805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ACCELERATE's <i>old-school boomer shooter</i>-inspired movement allows for very interesting combat. Swap between different weapons, each with their own primary / secondary fire and try to outmaneuver enemies to kill them. Dodge their attacks by using your slide and dash abilities. Upgrade the <strong>MVU</strong> to unlock special customizable abilities and choose the one that best fits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/bbf5e7ecb34aad3e27460bb34526544e.poster.avif?t=1763740805\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/bbf5e7ecb34aad3e27460bb34526544e.webm?t=1763740805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/bbf5e7ecb34aad3e27460bb34526544e.mp4?t=1763740805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Movement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement in ACCELERATE takes inspiration from games like <i>ULTRAKILL, Doom, Turbo Overkill</i> and classic arena shooters. Slide to gain speed, dash in any direction, launch yourself across arenas, and chain everything together into a constant flow. Use your weapons' special abilities to help you reach incredible speeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/632e1baadaa8a07b4e933a15d3984aeb.poster.avif?t=1763740805\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/632e1baadaa8a07b4e933a15d3984aeb.webm?t=1763740805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/632e1baadaa8a07b4e933a15d3984aeb.mp4?t=1763740805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/1ea117f60824438872b2154ee743828c.poster.avif?t=1763740805\" width=1170 height=427 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645620/extras/1ea117f60824438872b2154ee743828c.webm?t=1763740805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growing arsenal of weapons, each with their own unique primary and secondary fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, momentum-heavy movement built around sliding, dashing,